# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full extraction set:** the `-full` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr "**Pełny zestaw ekstrakcyjny:** do `-full` image stats the OCR and language detection dependences, so scanned documents are extracted too."

