# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory & Warehouse:** Manage stock levels, transfers, and warehouse operations. Supports barcode scanning, batch picking, and advanced routing."
msgstr "**Spis i Magazyn:** Zarządzanie zapasami, transfery i operacje magazynowe. Obsługuje skanowanie kodów kreskowych, zbieranie partii i zaawansowane routing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Foldery spisu.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) rozmowy [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), który tworzy jeden folder na rundę w `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (lub po prostu `<inventory-dir>` gdy jest jedna runda)Dla każdego folderu, `build_dev_inventory` rozwiązuje perapp runda wariant ładunku i piecze go do inwentarza `host_vars` jako `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` Przekroczenie. W związku z tym inwentaryzacja jest zmienno- rozwiązana na dysku; nie jest potrzebny selector runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` or `host_vars` of the target environment."
msgstr "**Pn**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` w `group_vars` lub `host_vars` środowiska docelowego."

# translated-by: libretranslate
