# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Application-level authentication is Funkwhale's own LDAP form ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), `LDAP_ENABLED`), not OIDC. Even a completed Keycloak round trip at the proxy leaves the Funkwhale session anonymous, so no authenticated surface appears."
